Leagues
Get all leagues appears in FIFA/FC history (including clubs from rest of world)

GET https://api.sofifa.net/leagues

Example response

{
  "data": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "name": "Superliga",
      "gender": "male",
      "country": "Denmark",
      "type": "domestic",
      "roster": "220001",
      "version": "22",
      "export": "160283",
      "latestRoster": "250016"
    },
    ...
  ]
}
Get all leagues for specific roster

GET https://api.sofifa.net/leagues/{roster}

Parameter	Type	Required	Description
roster	string	YES	The roster ID, which SoFIFA defines, can be found on the version select dropdown
Example response

{
  "data": [
    {
      "id": 1,
