Player Role
Get list of player roles

GET https://api.sofifa.net/playerRole/{version}

Parameter	Type	Required	Description
version	string	YES	Available value: 25
Example response

{
  "data": [
    {
      "name": "ROLE_GOALKEEPER+",
      "position": 0,
      "focuses": [
        "ROLE_DEFEND",
        "ROLE_BALANCED"
      ]
    },
    ...
  ]
}
